<h1>Mark Su</h1>
<p>Candidate for Mayor, Chicago, on the ballot February 23, 2027</p>
<p><a href="https://marksuformayor.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign website</a></p>
<p><a href="https://marksuformayor.com/?p=117" rel="nofollow noopener">Mark Su&#39;s campaign lists ten priorities, each with a short list of goals. Tap here to read them on his site, then come back to comment.</a></p>
<h2>AI summary</h2>
<h3>The platform</h3>
<p>Safety: Reduce violent crime and carjackings, recruit and keep more police officers, expand community policing, and support violence prevention and youth programs.</p>
<p>Economy: Attract employers, ease rules on small businesses, revive neighborhood shopping streets, and bring in manufacturing and technology investment.</p>
<p>Neighborhoods: Build affordable housing, fix up vacant buildings and lots, replace aging water mains, and step up street cleaning, graffiti removal, and action on illegal dumping.</p>
<p>Also: More career and technical education in schools, a safer CTA that runs more often, more childcare, and more senior and mental health services.</p>
<h3>Next to the other candidates</h3>
<p>Only Su: Faster graffiti removal, more street cleaning, action on illegal dumping, and wider broadband access.</p>
<p>Transit: Mendoza and Cardenas would put police on the CTA, and Kelly wants it safe at every hour. Carlisle and Su would run trains and buses more often.</p>
<h2>the more perfect platform</h2>
<p><a href="https://marksuformayor.com/?p=117" rel="nofollow noopener">Imported from marksuformayor.com</a></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/public-safety">Public Safety</a>: Reduce violent crime and carjackings. Increase police recruitment and retention. Expand community policing and neighborhood patrols. Improve emergency response times. Support violence prevention and youth intervention…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/economic-growth">Economic Growth</a>: Attract new businesses and employers. Reduce unnecessary regulations for small businesses. Revitalize neighborhood commercial corridors. Create more jobs for Chicago residents. Promote manufacturing and technology…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/city-finances">City Finances</a>: Balance the city budget responsibly. Reduce government waste and improve efficiency. Increase transparency in city spending. Protect taxpayers from excessive tax increases. Address long-term pension obligations…</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/affordable-housing">Affordable Housing</a>: Encourage construction of affordable housing. Reduce homelessness through housing and support services. Simplify permitting to lower housing costs. Rehabilitate vacant buildings and lots.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/stronger-public-schools">Stronger Public Schools</a>: Improve academic performance. Expand career and technical education. Increase school safety. Support teachers while focusing on student achievement. Strengthen partnerships with parents.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/better-public-transportation">Better Public Transportation</a>: Improve CTA safety and reliability. Reduce delays and increase service frequency. Modernize buses and train infrastructure. Improve accessibility for seniors and people with disabilities.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/infrastructure">Infrastructure</a>: Repair streets, sidewalks, and bridges. Replace aging water mains. Improve street lighting. Modernize public facilities. Expand broadband access.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/clean-and-beautiful-neighborhoods">Clean and Beautiful Neighborhoods</a>: Remove graffiti quickly. Increase street cleaning. Improve sanitation services. Expand tree planting and park improvements. Address illegal dumping.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/government-reform">Government Reform</a>: Increase transparency and accountability. Improve city customer service. Modernize city technology. Strengthen ethics rules. Reduce bureaucratic delays.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/candidate/KnLjUieynrQZjpMcCTdI2XuuIt83/support-for-families-and-seniors">Support for Families and Seniors</a>: Expand affordable childcare. Increase recreational programs for youth. Improve senior services. Support veterans. Expand mental health resources.</li>
</ul>
